 zone (GMT to local correction) \"sigFigs\" -- accuracy of timestamps \"snapLen\" -- maximum packet size \"network\" -- data link type \"count\" -- total number of packets read in this file. Your program will have to calculate this and for each packet   a packet number, starting at 0 (See posted format) \"tmSec\" -- timestamp seconds \"tmUSec\" -- timestamp microseconds \"inclLen\" -- number of octets/bytes of packet in the pcap file \"origLen\" -- number of octets/byets of packet on the network (will be same as inclLen unless bigger than snapLen  Sample output format: (newlines don't matter here. Also, order of fields in {...}  don't matter. ","topics":[],"score":237238,"global_rank":92778},{"name":"phamav/phamavProject3","owner":"phamav","html_url":"https://github.com/phamav/phamavProject3","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":237236,"global_rank":92789},{"name":"mbucchia/VarjoPatchCompositor","owner":"mbucchia","html_url":"https://github.com/mbucchia/VarjoPatchCompositor","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":237227,"global_rank":92821},{"name":"njhurst/bluesky","owner":"njhurst","html_url":"https://github.com/njhurst/bluesky","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":237225,"global_rank":92854},{"name":"NithishaSathishkumar/Transactional-Banking-System","owner":"NithishaSathishkumar","html_url":"https://github.com/NithishaSathishkumar/Transactional-Banking-System","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":237225,"global_rank":92866},{"name":"NithishaSathishkumar/Project4_CSS342","owner":"NithishaSathishkumar","html_url":"https://github.com/NithishaSathishkumar/Project4_CSS342","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":237225,"global_rank":92867},{"name":"NithishaSathis